<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="1CO" style="id">Lughuru Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">1 Wakolinto</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ibaluwa ya Mwanduso ya Pauli kwe iwanu wa Kolinto</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Wakolinto</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Wako</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ibaluwa ya Mwanduso ya Pauli kwe</para>
  <para style="mt1">Iwanu wa Kolinto</para>
  <para style="imt1">Ichilongole</para>
  <para style="ip">Ibaluwa ya mwanduso ya Wakolinto tsayandikikighwa na mtumighwa Pauli mne ghumwaka ghwa hamsini na tano kulawa Yesu helekighwe (1:1). Aino tsaikala ibaluwa ya mwanduso mna tsibaluwa mbili tsandikighwe na Pauli kwa kanisa lya Kolinto. Tsakandika ibaluwa ino hang'ali yokala Efeso ahala ng'ana yalamle ukwangila Kolinto hang'ali yoghenda na ukuya kulawa Makedoniya (16:5-9).</para>
  <para style="ip">Mne ibaluwa ino Pauli kakwidika mbuli itsighalighwe ne iwanu kuna yeye, itsilonga ghehile ighatendighwe mne kanisa lya Kolinto, ghehile agho hamwe ne ukwibaghula na ughoni. Ghumji ghwa Kolinto tsaghumanyika ghendo kwa ughoni, apfo ng'achiwile chinu cha kukangawatsa bae Pauli kulyandikila likanisa alyo pfinu apfo. Pfipfila ibaluwa ino ya mwanduso kwa iwanu wa Kolinto, isula ya 13 ina mbuli tsa unoghelo.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ighali mno</para>
  <para style="io">Mne isula ya 1:1-9, Pauli kowalamsa Wakorinto na kumlongela Imulungu mighede kwaajili yawo.</para>
  <para style="io">Mne isula ya 1:10-4:21, kolonga mbuli tsa ukwibaghula mne likanisa lye iwanu wa Korinto.</para>
  <para style="io">Mne isula ya 5-6, kolonga mbuli tsa ughoni na ukwighala mne libalatsa wawo kwa wawo.</para>
  <para style="io">Mne isula ya 7-15, Pauli kolonga mbuli tsa ukukwela, kulapfa nambiko kwe pfinyagho, na ukutsilihuka.</para>
  <para style="io">Mne isula ya 16, Pauli komalitsila kwa ukulonga mbuli tsake na sang'ano tsake.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Nene Pauli yanikemighwe niwe mtumighwa wa Kiristu Yesu ka Imulungu pfayabamile, na ndughu yetu Sostene.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Twomwandikilani mwemwe kanisa ilili mne ghumji ghwa Kolinto, mwemwe imkemighwe muwe iwanu wake wahenzeluka kwa ukwilunga na Yesu Kiristu, hamwe na wala wose iwali chila hanu iwomlomba Imtwatsa wetu Yesu Kiristu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Imulungu Aba wetu na Imtwatsa wetu Yesu Kiristu wawatendeleni uluso na yamwikeni tseghamba.</para>
  <para style="s">Mighede kwa Kiristu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nolonga mighede kwe Imulungu ghamatsuwa ghose kwa uluso iyawatendele mwemwe kubitila Yesu Kiristu. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Mana kwa ukwilunga ne Kiristu, mwemwe mbweda kwa chila chinu, mbweda mne ukulonga na mne ukumanya. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Usenga wa Kiristu wima pfinoghile mghati mwenu. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Apfo ng'amuhungukighwe bae na ghweko lyolyose kulawa kwa Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka, ka pfomumbeta Imtwatsa Yesu Kiristu yaghubulighwe. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Naye katsowakindilisa, katsoweng'a ingupfu mbaka utsighilo, ili mkale mwahela litotso mne litsuwa lye Imtwatsa wetu Yesu Kiristu. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Imulungu iyotogholighwa, kamkemani muwe sale wa Mwanaghe Yesu Kiristu, Imtwatsa wetu.</para>
  <para style="s">Ubaghutsi kwe iwanu iwomtoghola Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Ndughu tsangu, nowalomba kwa taghwa lye Imtwatsa wetu Yesu Kiristu mwilaghane kwa chila chinu chomlonga ili mleke kwibaghula mwemwe kwa mwemwe. Ghendoghendo mwalangule chinu chimwe na mlonge chicho. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ndughu tsangu, iwanu wangi kulawa ing'anda ya Kiloe wanongela ka mwemwe mwisonga. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nobama nilonge chanihulike kuna mwemwe, munu yumwe kolonga, “Nene nomuwinza Pauli,” na munu yungi kolonga, “Nene nomuwinza Apolo,” na yungi kolonga, “Nene nomuwinza Kefa” na yungi “Nene nomuwinza Kiristu.” <verse number="13" style="v"/>Angu Kiristu keghola? Angu Pauli tsakawambighwa mna msalaba kwaajili yako? Angu tsambatisighwa mughwe wanang'ina wa Pauli?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Mighede Imulungu kwaapfila simbatitse imunu wowose bae ila Kirispo na Gayo waliheka. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Apfo imunu wowose aleke kulonga ka mwemwe mbatisighwa muwe wanang'ina wangu. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nikumbuka, pfipfila tsanimbatisa Stefana na iwanu iwali mng'anda mwake, kuya imane ka nimbatisa imunu yungi. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kwaapfila Kiristu ng'anitumile bae kubatitsa, ila kuwapetela iwanu Imbuli Inoghile, na si kwa mbuli tsa kuwanogheletsa iwanu, ili lifwa lye Kiristu mna msalaba lileke kwoneka si chinu bae.</para>
  <para style="s">Kiristu iyo nzewele ne ingupfu ye Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kwaapfila usenga wa lifwa lya Yesu mne msalaba wakoneka ubotsi kwe iwanu iwakwagha, lekeni twetwe itukombolighwa twowona ngupfu ye Imulungu. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka gholonga,</para>
  <para style="q">“Nitsotsihinya nzewele tse wanu wane nzewele,</para>
  <para style="q">na tsimbutsi tse iwanu wane chisomo nitsotsasa kutali.”</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Walikwani wanu wane nzewele? Walikwani walangulitsi wa ghamalaghitso? Walikwani wane tsimbutsi sideke? Imulungu kalangusa ghendo ka nzewele ye iwanu we isi ina ubotsi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kwa nzewele ye Imulungu, ng'aidahika bae iwanu kummanya yeye kwa nzewele tsawo wenyegho, Imulungu tsakanoghelighwa kuwakombola iwanu iwotoghola kubitila usenga watuwapetela, aula iukoneka ubotsi kwa awala wane nzewele. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Wayahudi wobama kwona pfinzonza, Wagiriki wobama nzewele. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Lekeni twetwe, twowapetela imbuli ye Kiristu iyawambighwe mna msalaba, imbuli iikoneka ng'walo kwa Wayahudi na ubotsi kwe Iwanu iwali si Wayahudi. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Lekeni kwa awala iwakemighwe ne Imulungu, wose Wayahudi na Wagiriki, Kiristu iyo ngupfu ye Imulungu na nzewele ye Imulungu. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Kwaapfila achila ichikoneka ubotsi we Imulungu, china nzewele kubita nzewele ye imunu, na achila ichikoneka chahela ngupfu kwa Imulungu china ngupfu kubita ngupfu ye imunu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Ndughu tsangu, lelo mkumbuke hamkemighwe ne Imulungu, wengi mna mwemwe tsamkala mwahela nzewele ya chimunu, na si wengi bae imkalile ne ngupfu na si wengi bae imkalile ne ubala. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Lekeni Imulungu kasaghula pfinu ipfikoneka pfa ubotsi ipfili muisi kuwaghuma chinyala iwanu wane nzewele, Imulungu kasaghula ipfinu ipfilihela ngupfu, kuwaghuma chinyala awala wane ngupfu. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Imulungu kasaghula aghala ghawabetsile iwanu na aghala ighoneke si chinu bae, ili kughahinya aghala ghawonile iwanu chinu chikulu. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Imulungu katenda apfi ili imunu wowose aleke kwighoda hambele he Imulungu. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Imulungu iyo iyawatendike mwemwe mwilunge na Yesu Kiristu, iyawile nzewele yetu kulawa kwe Imulungu, twakoneka tunogha hambele he Imulungu, twenzeluka na tukombolighwa. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Apfo ka pfayandikighwe, “Iyobama kwighoda, yeghodele chayatendile Imtwatsa.”</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Usenga wa Kiristu iyawambighwe mna msalaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ndughu tsangu, hanitsile kuna mwemwe siwapeteleni bae ukweli we usenga we Imulungu kwa kulangusa ka nene nomanya ng'ani au kwa nzewele tse iwanu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mana hanikalile na mwemwe sibamile bae kumanya chinu chingi ila kummanya Yesu Kiristu yaliyeka, ayula iyawambighwe mna msalaba. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Hanitsile kuna mwemwe, tsanahela ngupfu, tsanidedema ghendo kwa kupfuka. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Usenga wangu na kupeta kwangu ng'akukalile bae kwa malonga gha nzewele ghane kukwegha iwanu, ila tsaghana ingupfu ye Ghumuhe we Imulungu. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Tsanenda apfi ili ukutoghola kwenu kuleke kukala mne hekima tse iwanu, ila ikale mne ngupfu ye Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="s">Inzewele ye Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Twopeta usenga we hekima kwa awala iwakomale mne ukutoghola, lekeni si ihekima ye muisi amu bae, wala si ihekima ye iwakulu we muisi amu iwakwaghitsa ngupfu. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nowapetela nzewele ye Imulungu iipfisighwe, iyaisaghule kwaajili ye ukwingila mne utunitso wake hata ng'ana isi yose ilumbighwe. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kuduhu iwakulu we isi yose iwamanyile nzewele ino. Wang'aimanyile wang'alekile kumuwamba mna msalaba Imtwatsa we utunitso. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Lekeni ka Ghamaandiko pfagholonga,</para>
  <para style="q">“Aghala ing'aghoneke wala kuhulikighwa,</para>
  <para style="q">aghala ng'ana ghakwalangulighwe mmoyo mwe imunu,</para>
  <para style="q">igho ghagho Imulungu ghawekile awala iwomnoghela.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Lekeni Imulungu katughubulila chinu acho kubitila Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka. Kwaapfila Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka kosakula chila chinu hata ipfinu ipfili mghati mwe Imulungu. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yuhi iyodaha kumanya aghala ighali mghati mwe imunu ka si muhe iuli mghati mwake mwenyegho? Pfipfila kuduhu iyomanya ipfinu pfe Imulungu ila Ghumuhe we Imulungu. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ng'atubokele bae muhe we iisi, ila tubokela Ghumuhe iyatumighwe ne Imulungu ili tumanye aghala ghose ghatwing'ighwe hela ne Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Apfo ng'atulonga bae kwe tsimbutsi itsilangulitsighwe ne nzewele tse iwanu, ila twolonga kwe tsimbutsi itsilangulitsighwe ne Ghumuhe, twolonga ipfinu pfa umuhe wa ukweli kwa awala iwane Ghumuhe. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Imunu yalihela Ghumuhe we Imulungu ng'odaha bae kubokela aghala igholawa kwe Imulungu, kwaapfila ghakoneka gha ubotsi kuna yeye, na ng'oghatanga bae, kwaapfila ghomanyika kwa kwapfilighwa ne Ghumuhe. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Lekeni imunu wowose yane Ghumuhe we Imulungu, kodaha kughatanga ghose, na kuduhu imunu iyodaha kumuhigha. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Ka Ghamaandiko pfagholonga,</para>
  <para style="q">“Yuhi yatsimanyile tsimbutsi tse Imtwatsa?</para>
  <para style="q">Yuhi yodaha kumlangulitsa Imtwatsa?” Lekeni twetwe tuna tsimbutsi tse Kiristu.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Iwatumwa we Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ndughu tsangu, nene silongile namwe bae ka iwanu imli ne Ghumuhe we Imulungu, lekeni tsanonga namwe ka iwanu we isi ino, ka iwana wadowado mne ukumtoghola Kiristu, <verse number="2" style="v"/>Tsaniweng'a matombo na si chijo chikomu bae, kwaapfila ng'amdahile bae kuchija. Hata sambi ng'amdaha bae kuchija. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kwaapfila mwemwe mng'ali mwokala ka iwanu we isi yose pfawokala. Angu pfii kuduhu chepfu na kwisonga mghati mwenu? Agho ghose gholangusa mwemwe mng'ali mwa iwanu we isi yose, na mwokala ka isi yose pfaibama. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Imunu yumwe ang'alonga, “Nene nomuwinza Pauli,” na munu yungi kolonga, “Nene nomuwinza Apolo.” Apfi ng'amtenda bae ka iwanu we isi yose pfawotenda?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Angu Apolo nani? Na Pauli nani? Twetwe twa iwatumwa we Imulungu yatumghalileni mwemwe ukutoghola, na chila munu kotenda isang'ano iyeng'ighwe ne Imtwatsa. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nene nihanda imbeghu, Apolo kaimwaghila ghamatsi, lekeni Imulungu iyo yaitendile ikule. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Apfo iyahandile si chinu bae wala ayula iyaimwaghile ghamatsi, ila Imulungu yaliyeka yaitendile yote, iyo imkulu. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Imunu yaihandile na imunu yaimwaghile ghamatsi wose weghala, na Imulungu katsomghweka chila imunu kwa sang'ano yake yaitendile. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kwaapfila twose twosang'ana hamwe ne Imulungu, mwemwe ka mghunda we Imulungu na ka ing'anda ye Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kwa ligweko lyangaile Imulungu, nyika lukwalambatsa ka imunu yadahile kutsenga pfinoghile, na imunu yungi kotsenga mchang'a mwake. Lekeni chila imunu iyotsenga yalangitse pfoyotsenga mchang'a mwake. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kuduhu imunu yungi iyodaha kwika lukwalambatsa lungi kubita yalwikighwe, iyo Yesu Kiristu. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Mchang'a mwe lukwalambatsa alo, imunu yumwe kodaha kutsengela nzahabu, au kutsengela pfetsa, au kutsengela ghamabwe gha bei ng'ulu au kutsengela mibiki, au kutsengela tsinyasi au mitsani. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ukunogha kwe isang'ano ya chila imunu kutsolangusighwa na kwikighwa mwatsi mne litsuwa lya Kiristu, kwaapfila mne litsuwa alyo ghumoto ghutsoghubula isang'ano ya chila imunu, ghumoto ghutsoghetsa tsisang'ano tsawo na kulangusa ka tsinogha. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Ka isang'ano ye imunu ng'ailakale mmoto, imunu ayo katsobokela lighweko. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Isang'ano ye imunu ing'alakala, imunu ayo katsolyaghitsa lighweko, lekeni yeye mwenyegho katsokombolighwa, ka kaswekuka mmoto.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Angu ng'ammanyile bae ka mwemwe mwa Ing'anda ye Imulungu, na Ghumuhe ghwe Imulungu kokala mghati mwenu? <verse number="17" style="v"/>Apfo imunu ang'aihinya ing'anda ye Imulungu, Imulungu katsomhinya. Kwaapfila ing'anda ye Imulungu idegheta, namwe mwa ing'anda ye Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Uleke kwighutsukila mwenyegho, imunu wowose yali mghati mwenu ang'eghoda kana nzewele mne isi ino, ng'apfu yawe mbotsi ili yawe na nzewele ya kweli. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kwaapfila nzewele ye isi ino ya ubotsi hambele he Imulungu. Ka pfayandikighwe, “Imulungu kowaghogha iwanu wane nzewele mne ukukengela kwawo.” <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kuya yandikighwa, “Imtwatsa koghamanya aghala ighawakwalangula iwanu wane nzewele ka ng'aghanoghile bae.” <verse number="21" style="v"/>Apfo imunu aleke kwighodela aghala ghawotenda iwanu. Mana ghose ghenu mwemwe. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yawe Pauli au yawe Apolo au Kefa au isi au ughima au lifwa au aghala ghali baha, au aghala ighakutsa, mana ghose ghenu mwemwe. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Mwemwe mwa iwanu we Kiristu, na Kiristu ka we Imulungu.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Iwatumighwa wa Kiristu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Iwanu watwone twetwe ka twawatumighwa wa Kiristu, yatwing'ighwe ing'onde ye kuwapetela iwanu tsimbuli itsipfisike tse Imulungu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Lelo ichibamighwa awala iweng'ighwe isang'ano wawe iwanu iwotogholighwa. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kuna nene si chinu bae ning'ahighighwa na mwemwe au ne imunu wowose. Wala nene sihigha nimwenyegho bae. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Mmoyo mwangu sihighighwa bae ne chinu chochose bae, lekeni chinu acho ng'achilangusa ka nahela totso. Imulungu iyo yonihigha nene. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Apfo mleke kuhigha mbuli yoyose ng'ana chipindi chake chipfike, mbetetse mbaka Imtwatsa hayatsakutsa. Katsoghubula aghala ighapfisighwe mchisi na katsogheka mwatsi aghala ighali mmoyo mwe iwanu. Baho chila imunu katsobokela sifa yake kulawa kwe Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ndughu tsangu, nimtumila Apolo na nene mwenyegho ili kubitila twetwe mwilangulitse mbuli ino, “Mghakinde ighandikighwe mne Ghamaandiko.” Mleke kwighodela munu yuno na kumbetsa yungi. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yuhi iyakutendile mkulu kubita munu yungi? Apfi Imulungu ng'akwing'ile bae pfose pfawinapfo? Ka kwing'ighwa, lelo ule wighoda ka ng'wing'ighwe bae?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Haya, ma mghapata ghose! Lelo ma muwa matajiri! Muwa wandewa bila ya twetwe! Nobama mng'awile iwandewa ili tuwe wandewa hamwe na mwemwe! <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kwaapfila nene pfanikona Imulungu katundenda twetwe iwatumighwa tuwe iwanu wa kuchisogho ghendo, ka iwanu iwahighighwe kukomighwa hambele he wamalaika ne iwanu. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Twetwe twawabotsi kwaajili ya kumtumikila Kiristu, lekeni mwemwe mna nzewele kwa kwilunga na Kiristu! Twetwe twahela ngupfu, lekeni mwemwe mna ngupfu, mwemwe ng'ambetsighwa bae, lekeni twetwe twobetsighwa. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Mbaka sambi tuna nzala na ng'ilu, twahela chokupfala, twotohighwa sideke, twahela hanu ho ukukala. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kuya twoghaya kusang'ana kwa ghamoko ghetu wenyegho. Hatulighitwa, twetwe twobaliki, hatudunuzighwa, twetwe todudumila, <verse number="13" style="v"/>hatulighighwa, twetwe twakwidika ghoya. Mbaka sambi twetwe twakoneka ka mibangu ye isi, na kwa chila imunu twakoneka wabewebewe!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Si kwandika bae agha ghose ili niwaghume chinyala, lekeni nowafunda ka wanangu iwonoghela. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Hata mng'awa ne iwemilitsi wengi kwa kwilunga ne Kiristu, lekeni aba wenu yumwe yaliheka, kwaapfila kwa kwilunga na Yesu Kiristu nene niwa aba wenu kwa kuwaghalila Imbuli Inoghile. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Apfo nowalomba mtende ka pfanitenda nene. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Apfo nomghalilani Timoteo, imwanangu mna ukwilunga na Kiristu iyonoghela na iyotogholighwa. Ayo katsomkumbusani inzila yaniiwinza nene iili mghati mwa Yesu Kiristu. Inzila iyanilangulitsa chila hanu mne makanisa ghose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Iwanu wamwenga kulawa mna mwemwe wandusa kwighoda, kulonga ka sikutsa bae kuna mwemwe. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Lekeni Imtwatsa ang'abama, nitsakutsa kuna mwemwe sambi, baho nitsakona mwenyegho, si ghawolonga ghaliheka, ila ne ingupfu iwali nayo iwanu awo iweghoda. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kwaapfila undewa we Imulungu si wa kulongalonga bae, ila wa ingupfu. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Choni ichiwanoghela? Nitse na fimbo, au nitse ne unoghelo na ghumoyo ghuholile?</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Mwibaghule ne ughoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Sambi yolongighwa ghendo ka mghati mwenu kuna ughoni, na ughoni awo ng'ana woneke bae hata kwe iwanu ing'awammanyile Imulungu. Imunu kowasa na imwehe wa aba wake! <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kuya lelo mdahatse kwighoda! Ing'awile ng'apfu mwemwe mwone usungu, na imunu iyatendile chinu acho yawingighwe mghati mwenu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Hata ka nakutali na mwemwe kwa lukuli, lekeni kwa ghumoyo nahamwe namwe. Ma nimuhigha imunu ayo yatendile chinu acho cha chinyala ka nabaho kuna mwemwe. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Hamtingana kwa taghwa lya Imtwatsa wetu Yesu nene na hamwe namwe mmoyo, na ngupfu ya Imtwatsa wetu Yesu yabaho, <verse number="5" style="v"/>mmwing'e Setani imunu ayo lukuli lwake luhinyighwe ili muhe wake ukombolighwe litsuwa alyo Imtwatsa hayatsokutsa kuwahigha iwanu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Kwighoda kwenu ng'akunoghile bae, angu ng'ampfimanyile bae ka hamira chidogho yotenda bulunge lya usaghe we chighate liwe kulu? <verse number="7" style="v"/>Muilapfe hamira ya ghumwande ye nzambi ili mdeghete ghendo. Kuya mwitseghala ne bulunge lya usaghe we pfighate pfa sambi ililihela hamira, ka pfambamighwa kuwa. Mana Pasaka wetu, Kiristu, tsakalapfighwa yawe nambiko. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Apfo, tutende chihungo acho cha Paska, si kwa hamira ye ghumwande, hamira ila ye nzambi na ghehile. Bali kwa chighate ing'achighumighwe hamira, iwo ghumoyo ghunoghile na ighulongesa!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Niwandikilani mne ibaluwa yangu ingi, mleke kwihanganya ne waghoni. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Silonga bae mleke kwihanganya ne iwanu ing'awammanyile Imulungu, awala iwaghoni, wabwa, wabapfi na awala iwotamanila pfinyagho. Mana ili kuwahepa iwanu awo wose mwobamighwa mlawe muisi mno. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Lekeni sambi nowandikilani mleke kwihanganya ne imunu wowose iyolonga komtoghola Kiristu aku kamghoni, ka mbwa, kotamanila pfinyagho, kana maligho, kopatika, ka mwihitsi Imunu ka ayo hata ukuja naye mleke.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Angu sang'ano yangu kuwahigha iwanu iwali kunze mwe kingili lyenu? Aku mwemwe ng'amuwahigha iwali mghati mwenu? <verse number="13" style="v"/>Imulungu mwenyegho katsowahigha awo iwali kunze, “Muwingeni imunu yehile iyali mghati mwenu!”</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Wakiristu wahighe maghomba ghawo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Imunu ang'esonga ne myaghe, ikuwatse yamghale hane libaratsa lye iwanu ing'awammanyile Imulungu? Ng'ambe kobamighwa yamghale kwe iwanu we Imulungu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Angu, ng'ammanyile bae ka iwanu we Imulungu watsoihigha iisi? Ka mwemwe mtsoihigha iisi, ule ng'amdaha bae kuigha maghomba ghano madomado? <verse number="3" style="v"/>Apfi ng'ammanyile bae ka mwemwe mtsowahigha malaika, pfii lelo mne ghamaghomba ighali muisi? <verse number="4" style="v"/>Hampata lighomba, apfi mwowakema iwanu ing'awolitoghola kingili lye iwanu we Imulungu wamuhigheni? <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nolonga apfi kuwaghumani mwemwe chinyala. Apfi kuduhu imunu mghati mwenu yane nzewele ye kuhigha lighomba lye wakiristu wayaghe? <verse number="6" style="v"/>Lekeni, mkiristu komghala mkiristu myaghe mne libaratsa na wowaleka iwanu iwang'amnyile Imulungu wawahighe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Kwa kwighala mwemwe kwa mwemwe kune ghamabalatsa, kolangusa mwemwe mtotsa ghendo. Ambe ing'awile ng'apfu mwemwe kubokighwa pfinu pfenu? <verse number="8" style="v"/>Lekeni mwemwe mwobunza na mwoboka, kuya agho mwowatendela wakiristu wayenu! <verse number="9" style="v"/>Angu ng'ammanyile bae iwanu wehile ng'awatsouhala bae undewa we Imulungu? Mleke kwighutsukila, si waghoni wala iwanzinzi, wala iwowatamanila pfinyagho, wala awala iwowasa ne iwamale weyawo, <verse number="10" style="v"/>wala wabapfi, wabwa, iwopatika, wang'enye, iwaboka weyawo, wala wane maligho, awo wose ng'awatsouhala bae undewa we Imulungu. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Wamwenga wenu tsamkala ka iwanu awo. Lekeni nzambi tsenu tsileghusighwa, mtendighwa muwe wenzeluka na mwikighwa kwa litaghwa lye Imtwatsa Yesu Kiristu na kwa ghumuhe ghwe Imulungu wetu.</para>
  <para style="s">Ng'uli tsenu tsimtunitse Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Imunu yungi kodaha kulonga, “Nilekelighwa kutenda pfinu pfose,” lekeni si pfinu pfose bae ipfikwapfila. Notoghola ka nodaha kutenda chila chinu, lekeni sileka bae chinu chochose chinongotse. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ichijo kwaajili ye munda na munda kwaajili ye ichijo, lekeni Imulungu katsofihinya pfose. Lukuli si kwaajili ye ughoni bae, ila kwaajili ye Imtwatsa, naye Imtwatsa koulolesa lukuli. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Imulungu kwa ingupfu yake kamtsiliula Imtwatsa, naye katsotusiliula twetwe pfipfila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Apfi, ng'ammanyile bae ka ng'uli tsenu pfilungo pfa Kiristu? Lelo nipfisole pfilungo pfa Kiristu nipfilunge na chiweghe? Bae! <verse number="16" style="v"/>Ebu ng'ammanyile bae ayula iyelunga na chiweghe kakuwa lukuli lumwe naye? Ka Ghamaandiko pfagholonga, “Nawo weli watsakuwa lukuli lumwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Lekeni ayula yelunga na Imtwatsa kakuwa naye kwa muhe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Mkale kutali ne ughoni. Nzambi tsose tsimwenga itsitendighwa ng'atsilagha lukuli, lekeni mghoni kolutendela nzambi lukuli lwake. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Apfi ng'ammanyile bae ka ng'uli tsenu tsa ing'anda ye Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka, iyali mghati mwenu, iyamumbokele kulawa kwe Imulungu? Apfo mwemwe mwa wanu we Imulungu. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kwaapfila tsamghulighwa kwa bei ng'ulu, apfo mumtunye Imulungu kwa ng'uli tsenu.</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Ukukwela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Apfo kwa mbuli ya aghala ghamwandike; pfinogha imunu yaleke kukwela. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Lekeni kwaapfila kuna ughoni sideke, chila mmale yawe na mwehe wake mwenyegho. Na chila pinga yawe na mmale wake mwenyegho. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Immale yatende chayobamighwa kumtendela mwehe wake, na ipinga yatende chayobamighwa kumtendela immale wake. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Lukuli lwa mwehe, si lwake yaliyeka bae, ila lwa immale wake pfipfila. Na lukuli lwa mmale si lwake yaliyeka bae ila lwa mwehe wake pfipfila. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Mleke kwiima, ila ka mwilaghana kwa ghamatsuwa chidogho, ili mdahe kukala kwa kumlomba Imulungu, kuya muyile keli ili Setani aleke kuwaghetsa kwaapfila ng'amdaha kududumila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Aghano noghalonga nene, na si laghitso bae. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nobama iwanu wawe ka nene pfanili, lekeni chila imunu keng'ighwa ne Imulungu ghweko lyake mwenyegho. Munu yumwe kana lino na munu yungi kana lila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Apfo kwa awala iwang'ali ng'ana wakwele na awala ng'ana wakwelighwe, nene nolonga pfino; pfinogha wang'akala ka nene pfanili. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Lekeni ka ng'amdaha bae kwikinga wenyegho, mkwele, kwaapfila pfinogha ng'ani kukwela kubita kusulukila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kwa awala iwakwelighwe na iwakwelile noweng'a laghitso lino, kuya si langu bae ila lye Imtwatsa. Mwehe yaleke kwileka na mmale wake. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Lekeni ang'atenda apfo, yakale bila ukukwelighwa, au yelamlitse ne immale wake. Naye immale aleke kumleka mwehe wake.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kwa awala iwasighale nolonga pfino. Nene mwenyegho, si Imtwatsa bae. Ka immale kana mwehe ing'ayomtoghola Yesu, na mwehe ayo kotoghola kukala na mmale wake, mmale aleke kumleka mwehe wake. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Na ka ipinga kana immale na immale ayo ng'omtoghola Yesu bae, ila kotoghola kukala na mwehe wake, ipinga ayo aleke kumlema mmale wake. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Kwaapfila immale yula ing'omtoghola Yesu kobokelighwa ne Imulungu kubitila mwehe wake. Na ipinga yula ing'omtoghola Yesu kohenzeluka kubitila immale wake. Ka si pfipfo bae, iwana wenu wang'alekile weha, lekeni ka pfaili, iwana wenu wenzeluka. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Ka imunu ing'omtoghola Yesu kobama yamleke myaghe, umleke atende apfo. Immale au ipinga iyotoghola Imulungu ng'oghomighwa bae kutenda apfo. Imulungu katukema twetwe tukale kwa tindiwalo. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Umanyatse, lamda ghwe mwehe kutsodaha kumkombola immale wako? Kuya umanyatse ghwe immale lamda kutsodaha kumkombola mwehe wako?</para>
  <para style="s">Mkale ka Imulungu pfayamkemileni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Apfo chila imunu yakale ka pfayagholelighwe ne Imulungu, yakale ka pfayakemighwe ne Imulungu. Alino laghitso lyangu kwa makingili ghose ghe iwanu we Imulungu. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ka imunu hayakemighwe tsakakala kengila ngoma, ayo aleke kwitenda ka ng'ana yengile ng'oma. Na ka imunu hayakemighwe tsakakala ng'engile ng'oma bae, aleke kwingila ng'oma. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kwaapfila, kwingila ngoma au kuleka kwingila ng'oma si chinu bae, ichinu chikulu, kukinda ghamalaghitso ghe Imulungu. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Chila imunu yakale ka pfayakemighwe ne Imulungu. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Apfi, haukemighwe tsakukala mtumwa? Uleke kwalangula, lekeni ka kopata uhuru utumile. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Kwaapfila yeye iyakemighwe ne Imtwatsa aku ka mtumwa, ayo kokombolighwa ne Imtwatsa. Pfipfila ayula iyakemighwe aku si mtumwa bae, ayo kakuwa mtumwa wa Kiristu. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Imulungu kamghulani kwa bei ng'ulu, lelo mleke kuwa watumighwa we iwanu. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Sale tsangu, chila munu na akale ka pfayakemighwe, kwaapfila Imulungu kahamwe na mwemwe.</para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli tsa iwanu ng'ana wakwele na wasaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Lelo, kwa imbuli ya awala ing'awakwelighwe bae, nene nahela laghitso kulawa kwe Imtwatsa, lekeni nene nolonga ghano ka imunu iyatogholighwe ne libatsi lye Imtwatsa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Pfanikona nene, ukughaya kwamghaya sambi, pfinogha mwemwe kukala ka pfamli. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Pfii ma kukwela? Uleke kumleka mwehe wako. Pfii ng'una ukwele bae? Uleke kubama ipinga. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Lekeni ung'akwela, ng'utotsa bae, na imwali ang'akwelighwa, ayo ng'ototsa bae, lekeni iwanu ka awo watsopata maghayo mengi ghe ughima uno, lekeni nene nobama agho ghaleke kuwapata mwemwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Sale tsangu, nobama nonge apfi, ghamatsuwa ighasighale si mengi bae, kulawa sambi awala iwakwelile wakale ka ng'awakwelile bae, <verse number="30" style="v"/>na awala iwolila wawe ka ng'awolila bae na awala wodeng'elela wawe ka ng'awodeng'elela bae. Na awala iwoghula ipfinu, pfinu apfo pfiwe ka si pfawo bae, <verse number="31" style="v"/>awala iwane sang'ano ne iisi ino wakale ka wahela sang'ano nayo. Kwaapfila ka pfatumanya, iisi ino ya sambi yofosa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Nobama mwemwe mleke kwalangula. Imunu yalihela mwehe kakwalangula sang'ano ye Imtwatsa, pfayatsomnogheletse Imtwatsa. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Immale iyakwelile kosang'ana ne tsing'onde tse iisi ili yamnogheletse mwehe wake, <verse number="34" style="v"/>naye kokweghighwa ne pfinu pfili. Ipinga yang'akwelighwe au imwali kakwalangula ng'onde tse Imtwatsa ili yawe mwenzeluka mlukuli na mne muhe. Lekeni ipinga iyakwelighwe kakwalangula ng'onde tse iisi, ili yamdeng'eletse mmale wake.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Nolonga apfi kwaapfila nobama niwapfile. Sibama bae kwingilila uhuru wenu, ila nobama mwemwe mtende ighanoghile na mwilapfe muwenyegho mne tsing'onde tse Imtwatsa bila kuwinza pfinu pfingi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Imunu ang'ona ng'otenda pfinoghile bae kuleka kumkwela mwali yamlapfile tsengele, na ka ng'odaha bae kukala bila kukwela, na ang'ona mwali wake miyaka yake yofosa, yatende pfayobama, ang'amkwela pinga ayo, ng'otenda nzambi bae. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Lekeni immale ayo ang'alamla imwenyegho kuleka kukwela, na ka kodaha kuleka kusulukila wapinga, ayo katsotenda pfinoghile ghendo kuleka kumkwela imwali ayo. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Apfo ayula yobama kukwela kotenda pfinoghile, na ayula yoleka kukwela kotenda pfinoghile ghendo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Ipinga iyakwelighwe kohighwa na mmale wake ka immale ayo mghima. Lekeni immale wake ang'afa, kodaha kukwelighwa keli na imunu yungi iyombama, lekeni immale ayo yawe iyommanya Kiristu. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Lekeni pfanikona nene, ng'apfu ghendo ipinga ayo ang'akala yaliheka, na nene nakona pfipfila nina Ghumuhe we Imulungu.</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ye ipfijo ipfitambikighwe pfinyagho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Lelo, aino imbuli ye pfijo ipfitambikighwe pfinyagho.</para>
  <para style="p">Twomanya ghendo ka “twetwe wose tuna chisomo”, ka pfawolonga. Lekeni ukumanya ako kwowatenda iwanu weghode, ila unoghelo wotsenga. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Imunu ang'alonga komanya chinu, ng'omanya chinu bae ka pfoyobamighwa kumanya. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Lekeni imunu iyomnoghela Imulungu komanyika na Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Apfo, mne imbuli ye ipfijo ipfitambikighwe pfinyagho, twomanya ghendo ka chinyagho si chinu bae muisi mno, na twomanya ghendo kuduhu Imulungu yungi ila Imulungu wetu yaliyeka. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Hata ka kuna pfinu ipfikemighwa milungu muisi mno au kulanga, na hata ka kuna milungu ne iwandewa wengi, <verse number="6" style="v"/>lekeni kuna twetwe Imulungu ka yumwe; Aba, yalumbile pfinu pfose, kubitila yeye twetwe twa waghima. Kuya tuna Imtwatsa yumwe, iyo Yesu Kiristu, kubitila yeye pfinu pfose tsapfilumbighwa, na twetwe twa waghima kubitila yeye.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Lekeni si chila imunu bae komanya agha ghose. Iwanu wamwenga iwatsowele kutambikila pfinyagho, mbaka leloli wang'aja ichijo acho wotonga chilawa kwe ipfinyagho. Na kwaapfila mimoyo yawo yahela ingupfu, wetenda iwenyegho weha kwa ukuja ichijo acho. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ichijo ng'achidaha bae kukughala habehi ne Imulungu, tung'aleka kuchija ng'atuhungukighwa na chinu bae, tung'aja ng'atukongetsighwa chinu bae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Lekeni mwalangitse pfamlekelelighwe ukutenda pfinu, mleke kuwahonza awalaiwotoghola chidogho wengile mnzambi. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Ka imunu yotoghola chidogho kakona ghweghwe iumanyile kwakuja mne ng'anda ye pfinyagho, pfii ng'atsoghumighwa ghumoyo bae kuja ichijo ichitambikighwe pfinyagho? <verse number="11" style="v"/>Apfo imunu yuno yane noghola ilihela ngupfu, iyo Kiristu yafile kwaajili yake ng'atsakwagha bae kwaajili ya achila ghweghwe kochikema ukumanya? <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ka mwowaghitsa pfino wakiristu wayenu, na kutsilagha noghola tsawo itsilihela ngupfu, mwomtendela nzambi Kiristu. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Apfo ichijo ching'amtenda mkiristo miyangu yaghwe mnzambi, sitsakuja bae inyama, kwaapfila ning'aja nitsomhonza ndughu yangu yaghwile mnzambi.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Sang'ano tse Iwatumighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Angu nene sina ng'ombolighwe bae? Pfii nene si mtumighwa bae? Apfi nene simwonile Imtwatsa wetu Yesu? Angu mwemwe si ghamatunda ghe isang'ano yangu bae? <verse number="2" style="v"/>Hata ka kwa wamwenga nene si mtumighwa bae, lekeni kuna mwemwe nene na mtumighwa. Mwemwe mwa wakalangama we utumighwa wangu kwaapfila mwilunga ne Imtwatsa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Apfi pfipfo pfaniyamila kwe iwanu iwonighutsa. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Pfii ng'atubamighwa ukwing'ighwa bae ichijo na choukunwa kwaajili ye sang'ano yetu? <verse number="5" style="v"/>Apfi twahela haki ye ukumsola mwehe iyomtoghola Kiristu na kwanga naye mne ghumwanza ka pfawotenda iwatumighwa wangi na iwandughu we Imtwatsa na Kefa. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Au twetwe tuliheka nene na Balinaba itubamighwa kusang'ana ili tupate aghala ighatubama. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Angu asikali wachi iyoghenda kwing'ondo keliha imwenyegho? Yuhi iyohanda mitsabibu aku ng'akuja bae ghamatunda ghake? Yuhi iyodima iwanyama aku ng'akunwa bae matombo ghawo?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Apfi agha ghanilonga nolonga gha chimunu? Angu Ghamalaghitso gha Musa nagho ng'agholonga apfi bae? <verse number="9" style="v"/>Mana yandikighwa mne Ghamalaghitso gha Musa, “Haumtumila ing'ombe kupfuna uhunga, uleke kumwoha chibang'wa.” Pfii, Imulungu kolonga mbuli tse ng'ombe? <verse number="10" style="v"/>Apfi hayalongile apfo ng'alongile mbuli tsetu bae? Tsayandikighwa kwaajili ya twetwe ghendo. Kwaapfila ayula iyolima na ayula iyopfuna, wose wana haki yo ukubetela ipfijo. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ka twetwe tuhanda imbeghu ye umuhe mghati mwenu, apfi chinu chikulu twetwe tung'apata aghala ghatubama kulawa kuna mwemwe? <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ka wanu wamwenga wodaha ukughalolela agho kulawa kuna mwemwe. Apfi twetwe ng'atudaha bae ukughalolela agho kubita wawo?</para>
  <para style="p">Lekeni twetwe ng'atutumile bae uwetso awo. Ila tsatududumila chila chinu ili tuleke kuighoma Imbuli Inoghile ye Kiristu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Apfi ng'ammanyile bae, awala iwosang'ana mne ing'anda ye Imulungu wopata ipfijo pfawo mng'anda amo, na awala iwalapfa nambiko hanu ha kutambikila wopata ipfinu pfe inambiko ayo? <verse number="14" style="v"/>Pfipfila, Imtwatsa kalaghitsa apfi, awala iwopetela iwanu Imbuli Inoghile wabokele ipfijo pfawo kulawa mne imbuli inoghile.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Lekeni nene situmile bae uleghelo hata umwe. Wala sighandika bae ghano ili mnendele apfo. Ng'apfu nene nife kubita kumtenda imunu yambone ka nene neghoda hela. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Ka nene nopeta Imbuli inoghile, acho si chinu cha kwighodela bae. Ayo iyo sang'ano yaning'ighwe. Na nitsolyona ka siipeta bae Imbuli inoghile! <verse number="17" style="v"/>Ning'atenda sang'ano ino kwa ukubama mwenyegho, ning'alolele ukughwekighwa, lekeni ka nene nobamighwa kuitenda sang'ano ayo, ayo yolangusa ka Imulungu kangaya sang'ano ayo niitende. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Lelo nobokela maliho ghachi? Hanipetela iwanu Imbuli inoghile, sibama bae kwing'ighwa chinu, wala silomba maliho kwaajili ye sang'ano ye kupeta Imbuli inoghile.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Nene si mtumwa wa imunu wowose bae. Lekeni netenda imwenyegho kuwa mtumwa wa chila imunu ili nimpatile Kiristu iwanu wengi. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Haning'ali nisang'ana na Wayahudi tsanikala ka Myahudi, ili niwapate Wayahudi; hata ka nene imwenyegho silongotsighwa bae na malaghitso gha Musa, lekeni tsanikala ka nolongotsighwa na malaghitso agho ili niwapate awala iwalongotsighwa na malaghitso gha Musa. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Haning'ali nisang'ana na awala iwalihela malaghitso gha Musa, tsanikala ka nahela malaghitso, ili niwapate awala iwalihela malaghitso gha Musa. Kulonga apfo si ka nene sighawinza malaghitso hambele he Imulungu, kwaapfila nina malaghitso hambele he Kiristu. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Hanisang'ane na awala wane noghola ilihela ngupfu, tsanikala ka nina noghola yangu yahela ngupfu ka wawo pfawali, ili niwapate awo wane noghola ilihela ngupfu. Nitenda chila chinu kwe iwanu wose ili nidahe kuwatenda wakombolighwe kwa nzila yoyose ila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Notenda agha ghose kwaajili ya imbuli inoghile, ili mbokele balaka tsake. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Apfi ng'ammanyile bae iwanu hawotsuma, wose wotsuma, lekeni ayula iyowalongola weyaghe iyo iyoghwekighwa? Mtsume pfipfo ili mghwekighwe. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Imunu wowose iyobama kuwahuma weyaghe mna ukutsuma, tanu kalekagha ghose, kotenda apfo ili yabokele taji ilihinyika, lekeni twetwe twotenda apfo ili tubokele taji ing'alihinyika bae. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Apfo notsuma ka imunu iyobama kuhuma. Sitowa bae ka imunu yetowa ne libeho, <verse number="27" style="v"/>ila noludununza lukuli Iwangu luwe na ngupfu na nolutenda luwe mtumwa wangu, notenda apfo ili hanimalitsa kuwapetela iwanu wangi nene imwenyegho ndeke koneka sinoghile bae kubokela ghweko.</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Pauli kokanya ukutamanila pfinyagho kulekighwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ndughu tsangu, sibama bae mwemwe mleke kumanya ka aba tsenu tsawahasi mwe libingu lila, na wose tsawaloka mne bahali ila ndung'u. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Wose tsawabatitsighwa wawe ka wa Musa mne libingu na mne ibahali. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Wose tsawaja ichijo chichila che ghumuhe, <verse number="4" style="v"/>pfipfila tsawanwa chokunwa chichila che ghumuhe, mana tsawanwa kulawa mne bambalawe lye umuhe iliwawinzile, bambalawe lila tsalikala Kiristu imwenyegho. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Lekeni, Imulungu ng'anoghelighwe na wamwenga wawo. Apfo ng'uli tsawo tsatsipwililika mnyika.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Apfo agha ghose ghalawila ili kutukanya tuleke kuwa iwanu wa kusulukila ghehile ka wawo pfawasulukile. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Mleke kutamanila pfinyagho, ka wamwenga pfawatendile. Ka pfayandikighwe, “Iwanu tsawakala hasi waja na wanwa, kuya wema wapfina pfihile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Mleke kutenda uweghe, ka iwanu wangi pfawatendile, kwa litsuwa limwe iwanu elufu ishilini na wadatu tsawafa. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Mleke kumghetsa Kiristu ka iwanu wangi pfawamghetsile, wose tsawafa kwa kulumighwa ne wanzoka. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Mleke kunung'unika ka iwanu wangi pfawatendile, nawo tsawakomighwa na mtumighwa we kulanga we lifwa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Agha ghose ghawalawila wawo ili twetwe tulangulitsighwe, ghandikighwa ili ghatukanye twetwe itukala mne ghamatsuwa ighali habehi na utsighilo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Apfo, ayula iyebona kema pfinoghile, yalangitse aleke kughwa. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ghamaghetso ghampatile si magheni bae kwe iwanu. Imulungu kotogholighwa, naye ng'atsowaleka mghetsighwe kubita pfamdaha. Lekeni hamghetsighwa, yeye katsoweng'a ingupfu yo kududumila, na inzila yo kulawila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Lelo ndughu tsangu wanoghelighwa, mkale kutali ne ukutamanila pfinyagho. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nolonga na mwemwe ka iwanu wane tsimbutsi, mwalangule achino chanilonga. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Hatubaliki ichikombe che ichijo che ukumkumbuka lmtwatsa, apfi ng'atwilunga bae na idamu ya Kiristu? Pfii hatubena chighate ng'atwilunga bae na lukuli lwa Kiristu? <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kwaapfila hana chighate chimwe, na twetwe yatuli wengi, twalukuli lumwe, mana twetwe wose twegholela chighate chicho.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Muwalole Wayahudi wenyegho, awala iwakuja nambiko welunga ne Imulungu kubitila nambiko atso. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Lelo nonge choni? Ichijo ichitambikighwe pfinyagho chinu chikulu kubita ichijo? Na ipfinyagho chinu chikulu? <verse number="20" style="v"/>Bae! Chanilonga nene chicho chino, nambiko tse iwanu ing'awammanyile Imulungu wowalapfila pfinyamkela, si Imulungu bae. Na nene sibama bae mwilunge na ipfinyamkela. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Ng'amdaha bae kuchinwela ichikombe che Imtwatsa aku mwochinwela chikombe che pfinyamkela. Ng'amdaha ukuja mne metsa ye Imtwatsa na baho mne metsa ya pfinyamkela. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Angu twobama tumtende Imtwatsa yawe na chepfu. Apfi mwopfikitsa tuna ngupfu kubita yeye?</para>
  <para style="s">Utende ghose kwa utunitso we Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Wamwenga wolonga, “Ipfinu pfose ng'apfighomighwa bae,” lekeni nene nolonga si pfose ipfikwapfila. Kuya wamwenga wolonga, “Ipfinu pfose ng'apfighomighwa bae,” lekeni nene nolonga, si pfose ipfitsenga. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Imunu wowose mna mwemwe aleke kwibamila yaliyeka ghanoghile, ila yawabamile na weyaghe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Mje chochose ichihutsighwa mne maghulilo bila kughutsaghutsa kwaajili ye imimoyo yenu. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Kwaapfila Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka gholonga, “Isi ya Imulungu na ghose ighali mumo ghake.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Ka imunu ing'ayomtoghola Yesu komkemani mkaje ichijo kaye yake, namwe mwobama kughenda, mje chochose ichikighwe hambele henu bila kughutsaghutsa kwaajili ya imimoyo yenu. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Lekeni imunu yungi ang'akulongela, “Chijo chino chitambikighwa pfinyagho,” uleke kuja kwaajili ye imunu iyakulongele na kwa kwaajili ya ghumoyo. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Nolonga, kwaajili ya ghumoyo wa munu yungi si kwaajili ya ghumoyo ghwako bae,</para>
  <para style="p">Imunu yungi ang'aghutsa, “Ule lelo ukukombolighwa kwangu kuhighighwe ne ghumoyo ghwe imunu yungi? <verse number="30" style="v"/>Ka nolonga mighede kwe Imulungu kwa ichijo chanikuja, ebali imunu yungi yanonge pfihile kwa ichijo acho?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Apfo, chochose chamtenda, ukuja au ukunwa, mtende ghose kwa utunitso we Imulungu. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Mleke kuwatenda Wayahudi wala Iwanu iwali si Wayahudi, wala makingili ghe iwanu we Imulungu wekwale. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Muwe ka nene, nene nobama kuwadeng'eletsa wanu wose mna ghose ghanitenda. Mana sibamila niliheka ghanoghile, ila nowabamila ghanoghile iwanu wose ili wakombolighwe.</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Mniwinze ka nene pfanimuwinzile Kiristu.</para>
  <para style="s">Ukughubika litwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Nomtunyani kwa kunikumbuka, ne ukughakinda malaghitso ghaniweng'ileni. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Lekeni nobama mwemwe mmanye pfino, Kiristu iyo litwi lya chila mmale, na mmale iyo litwi lya pinga wake, na Imulungu iyo litwi lya Kiristu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Apfo imunu wowose iyolomba au iyopeta usenga iulawa kwe Imulungu aku kaghubika litwi lyake, ayo komghuma chinyala Kiristu. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Na ipinga wowose hayolomba au hayopeta usenga we Imulungu aku litwi lyake ng'alighubikighwe bae, komghuma chinyala mmale wake, ipinga ayo keghala na ipinga iyaghetile mvili tsake tsose. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ka ipinga ng'oghubika bae litwi lyake, ng'apfu yabehe mvili tsake. Lekeni ka chinyala kwe ipinga kugheta mvili tsake au kubeha mvili tsake, yaghubike litwi lyake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Immale ng'obamighwa bae yaghubike litwi lyake, kwaapfila yeye keghala ne Imulungu na ka utunitso we Imulungu. Lekeni ipinga ka utunitso we immale. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kwaapfila, immale ng'alawile bae kwe ipinga, ila ipinga kalawa kwe immale. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Immale ng'alumbighwe bae kwaajili ye ipinga, ila ipinga tsakalumbighwa kwaajili ya immale. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Apfo kwaajili ye malaika, ipinga yaghubike litwi lyake, ili chiwe chitango cha uwetso uli mchanya mwake. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Lekeni, hambele he Imtwatsa ipinga ng'omuhila bae immale, na immale ng'omuhila bae ipinga. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Mana ka ipinga pfayalawile kwe immale, pfipfila immale naye kakwelekighwa ne ipinga, lekeni ghose gholawa kwe Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Mlamle wenyegho, angu pfinogha kwe ipinga kumlomba Imulungu aku ng'aghubike bae chinu chochose mwitwi mwake? <verse number="14" style="v"/>Hata iwanu pfatulumbighwe pfolangusa ghendo, mmale kuwa na mvili ng'ulu chinyala kuna yeye, <verse number="15" style="v"/>lekeni ipinga ang'awa na mvili ng'ulu, acho chinu chinoghile kuna yeye. Kwaapfila keng'ighwa mvili ng'ulu tsimghubike. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Imunu ang'abama kwihisanya mna mbuli ino, twetwe twahela matsowela ghangi. Wala makingili ghe iwanu we Imulungu ghahela matsowela ghangi.</para>
  <para style="s">Chijo che ukukumbuka lifwa lye Imtwatsa</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 26:26-29; Maliki 14:22-25; Luka 22:14-20)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Mne malaghitso ghano ghanimwing'ani siwatunya bae, mana mne mitingano yenu yo ukumtamanila Imulungu mwotenda ghehile ghendo kubita ighanoghile. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Aho mwanduso tsanihulika hamtingana mne mitingano yenu mwebaghula. Nani chidogho notoghola, <verse number="19" style="v"/>mana kobamighwa kuwe na ubaghutsi mghati mwenu, ili awala iwatogholighwe ne Imulungu woneke pfinoghile. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Hamtingana hamwe, mwopfikitsa mwakuja ichijo che ukumkumbuka Imtwatsa, kumbe bae! <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kwaapfila hamkuja, chila munu koghendelela ukuja bila kuwabeta wayenu, mbaka wangi wokala ne nzala aku wamwenga wapatika. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Angu ng'amdaha bae ukuja na kunwa mmakae mwenu? Ebu mwolibesa kingili lye iwanu we Imulungu, na kuwaghuma chinyala iwanu iwalihela chinu? Lelo niwalongeleni choni? Niwatunye? Mbe siwatunya bae kwaajili ya chinu acho.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Mana nighabokela kulawa kwe Imtwatsa ghamalangulitso ghanimwing'eni, Imtwatsa Yesu chilo chila chayahundukighwe, tsakasola chighate, <verse number="24" style="v"/>hayamalitse kulonga mighede kwe Imulungu, kachibena, kalonga, “Aluno lukuli lwangu, lwamwing'ighwe mwemwe, mtende apfi kwa kung'umbuka nene.” <verse number="25" style="v"/>Pfipfila hayamalitse ukuja, kasola chikombe, kalonga, “Chikombe chino laghano lya sambi lye idamu yangu. Mtende apfi chila hamkunwa kwa kung'umbuka nene.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Mana chila hamkuja chighate chino na kuchinwela chikombe chino, mwolipeta lifwa lye Imtwatsa, mbaka hayatsakuya keli. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Apfo imunu wowose iyakuja chighate chino na kuchinwela chikombe che Imtwatsa ing'apfibamighwa, ayo katsokuwa na totso kwa lukuli na idamu ye Imtwatsa. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Apfo, chila imunu tanu yelolese mwenyegho, kuya kodaha ukuja chighate acho na ukunwela chikombe acho. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Mana imunu wowose iyakuja na kunwa bila kulutanga lukuli lwe Imtwatsa chinu chachi, ayo kehigha imwenyegho. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Kwaajili ayo iwanu wengi mghati mwenu wahela ingupfu na watamu, na wamwenga wafa. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Twing'elolesa pfinoghile, tung'alekile kuhighighwa ne Imulungu. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Lekeni hatuhighighwa ne Imtwatsa twolangulisighwa tunoghe ili tuleke kuhighighwa hamwe ne iisi yose.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Apfo ndughu tsangu, hatwitingana hamwe ukuja ichijo che Imtwatsa, chila munu yambete myaghe. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Imunu ang'awa ne nzala, aje ukaye yake ili hamtingana kuleke kuwa ne ukuhighighwa ne Imulungu. Lekeni agho ghangi, nitsowalangulitsani hanikutsa.</para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Pfigholelo kulawa kwa Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Lelo ndughu tsangu nobama mmanye pfinoghile mbuli tse pfigholelo ipfilawa kwe Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mwomanya hamng'ali ng'ana mumtange Imulungu, tsamlongosighwa mne nzila tsihile muitamanile milungu ilihela ughima. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nobama mmanye pfino, kuduhu imunu iyolongosighwa ne Ghumuhe ghwe Imulungu iyodaha kulonga “Yesu yalighitighwe,” kuya kuduhu imunu iyodaha kulonga “Yesu iyo Imtwatsa,” bila kulongosighwa na Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kuna pfigholelo pfingi tofwautitofwauti, lekeni Ghumuhe iyopfilapfa ka yumwe. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kuya kuna nzila tofwautitofwauti tsa sang'ano, lekeni Imtwatsa ka yumwe. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Kuya kuna nzila tofwautitofwauti tse kutenda sang'ano atso, lekeni Imulungu iyo yuyo iyosang'ana ng'onde tsose kwe iwanu wose. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka kelangusa kwa chila imunu kwa nzila tofwautitofwauti kwaajili ye iwanu wose. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ghumuhe komwing'a imunu yumwe mbuli tsa nzewele, Ghumuhe yuyo komwing'a imunu yungi uwetso we ukumanya pfinu. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ghumuhe yuyo komwing'a imunu yungi ukutoghola, na Ghumuhe yuyo komwing'a imunu yungi uwetso wa kuwahonetsa iwanu. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka komwing'a imunu yumwe uwetso we kutenda pfihulo, Ghumuhe yuyo komwing'a imunu yungi uwetso we kulapfa unabii na imunu yungi kubaghula pfigholelo ipfili pfa Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka na ipfili si pfa Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka bae, yungi kulonga lugha ing'atsimanyika bae, na yungi kutsifasiri. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Atso tsose sang'ano tsa yuyo yumwe Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka, naye komgholela chila imunu ka pfoyobama imwenyegho.</para>
  <para style="s">Lukuli lumwe lekeni pfilungo pfingi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Lukuli lwa lumwe, hata ka lulumbighwa na pfilungo pfingi, na hata ka una pfilungo pfingi, lekeni pfolumba lukuli lumwe. Apfo pfipfo pfaili kwa Kiristu. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kwaapfila twetwe wose tsatubatitsighwa kwa Ghumuhe yumwe, tuwe Wayahudi au si Wayahudi bae, tuwe watumwa au si watumwa bae, wose tunwesighwa Ghumuhe yuyula yumwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Kwaapfila lukuli ng'alulumbighwe bae kwa chilungo chimwe, ila kwa pfilungo pfingi. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Mghulu ung'alonga, “Kwaapfila nene sili ghumoko bae, nene si wa lukuli.” Apfi mghulu utsokuwa si wa lukuli bae? <verse number="16" style="v"/>Na lighutwi ling'alonga, “Kwaapfila nene sili inenge bae, nene si wa lukuli bae.” Apfi lighutwi litsokuwa si lya lukuli bae? <verse number="17" style="v"/>Ka lukuli lwose lung'awile inenge, ukuhulika kung'akalile kwani? Na lukuli lwose lung'awile lighutwi, ukunusa kung'akalile kwani? <verse number="18" style="v"/>Lekeni Imulungu keka pfilungo pfose mne lukuli lwa chila munu ka pfayabamile pfiwe. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Ka pfilungo pfose pfing'awile chilungo chimwe, lukuli lung'akalile kwani! <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ka pfaili, kuna pfilungo pfingi, lekeni lukuli lwa lumwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Inenge ng'aidaha bae kughulongela ghumoko, “Sikubama bae!” Wala litwi ng'alidaha bae kughalongela maghulu “Simbamani bae!” <verse number="22" style="v"/>Lekeni kubita agho, yolangusa ipfilungo pfila ipfikoneka pfahela ngupfu, apfo pfipfo chinu chikulu, <verse number="23" style="v"/>na pfilungo pfila pfatulonga pfahela heshima, twopfing'a heshima ng'ulu, na pfilungo ipfikoneka ng'apfinoghile, twopfighubika pfinoghile. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Lekeni pfilungo pfetu ipfinoghile sideke ng'apfibama bae kuhambighwa. Imulungu mwenyegho kalwika pfipfo lukuli, na kapfing'a heshima pfilungo pfila ipfihungukighwe. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Apfo kuleke kuwa na ubaghutsi mne lukuli, ila pfilungo pfose pfilolese. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Chilungo chimwe ching'atama, pfilungo pfose pfotama hamwe nacho, na chilungo chimwe ching'atunyighwa, pfilungo pfose pfodeng'elela hamwe nacho.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Apfo chila munu mghati mwenu ka lukuli lwa Kiristu, na chila munu ka chilungo cha lukuli alwo. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Na mne kingili lye iwanu we Imulungu, Imulungu keka wa mwanduso iwatumighwa, wa keli manabii, wa kadatu iwalangulitsi, wa kane awala iwotenda pfihulo, na wala iweng'ighwe ingupfu yo kuwahonetsa iwatamu, na iwodaha kuwapfila iwanu wangi, kuya pfilongotsi na iwolonga lugha ing'atsimanyika. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Si wanu wose bae watumighwa au manabii au walangulitsi. Na si wose bae iwotenda pfihulo. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Si wose iwodaha kuhonetsa iwanu. Si wose iwolonga kwa lugha ing'atsimanyika. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Apfo mbame pfigholelo pfikulu.</para>
  <para style="p">Nani leloli nowalangusa nzila inoghile kubita nzila tsose.</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Unoghelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hata ka nodaha kulonga lugha tse iwanu na tse wamalaika we kulanga, lekeni ka nahela unoghelo, nene neghala na malati iikema hela au tsimbughi. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Hata ka nodaha kupeta usenga we Imulungu, na kumanya ghose na mbuli na kutanga chila chinu, hata ka nodaha kusoghetsa pfighongo kwa ukutoghola kwangu, lekeni ka nahela unoghelo, nene si chinu bae. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Hata ka ning'aweng'a iwahingwa pfinu pfose pfanilinapfo na kulwika lukuli lwangu lulakale mlambi, lekeni ka nahela unoghelo, nene sipata chinu bae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Munu yane unoghelo kodudumila, kana libatsi, kahela chepfu, ng'etunya bae wala ng'eghoda bae. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Imunu yane unoghelo kana mahala, ng'abamagha bae mbuli tsake mwenyegho, ng'asumkagha bae kona maya, kuya ng'ekagha bae fondogholo mmoyo. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Imunu yane unoghelo ng'odeng'elelela bae ghehile, ila kodeng'elela ukweli. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yane unoghelo kodudumila ghamatsuwa ghose, kotoghola ghamatsuwa ghose, ghamatsuwa ghose kololela bila kwipfa, kodudumila ghamatsuwa ghose.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Unoghelo ng'autsighagha bae, ka hana unabii, awo utsotsigha, ka hana ukulonga kwa lugha ing'atsimanyika, ako kutsomala, ka hana ukumanya, kutsoluta. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Mana ukumanya kwetu ng'akutimile bae, na ukulapfa unabii kwetu ng'akutimile bae, <verse number="10" style="v"/>lekeni Imulungu hayatsotimilitsa ghose, achila ing'achitimile chitsohupa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Haning'ali mdodo, tsanonga ka mwana mdodo, tsanyalangula ka mwana mdodo, tsanimanya ka mwana mdodo. Lekeni hanikulile nighaleka aghala gha udodo. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Mana sambi twolola ka chihanga ing'achikoneka pfinoghile bae mne chilolelo, lekeni hambele tutsolola chihanga kwa chihanga. Ghanimanya sambi ng'aghatimile bae, kuya hambele nitsomanya ghose ka Imulungu pfonimanya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Lelo pfinu pfidatu ipfighendelela; kuko ukutoghola na lolelo na unoghelo, lekeni chikulu kubita pfose uwo unoghelo.</para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Pfinu pfimwenga pfe Ghumuhe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Muubame unoghelo, na mbame pfigholelo pfingi pfa Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka, kubita pfose mpate chigholelo cha kuwapetela iwanu usenga we Imulungu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kwapfila imunu wowose iyolonga kwa lugha ing'atsimanyika, ayo ng'olonga bae ne iwanu, ila kolonga ne Imulungu, kwaapfila kuduhu imunu iyohulika. Kolonga pfinu ipfipfisike kwa ngupfu ye Ghumuhe. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Lekeni awala iwopeta usenga we Imulungu wolonga ne iwanu na kuwapfila, kuwaghuma ghumoyo na kuwakanza. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ayula iyolonga kwa lugha ing'atsimanyika, ketsenga mwenyegho, ila ayula iyopeta usenga we Imulungu kowatsenga iwanu we Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nene nobama mwemwe mwose mlonge kwa lugha ing'atsimanyika, lekeni kubita alyo nobama mwemwe mlonge usenga we Imulungu. Kwaapfila ayula iyolonga usenga we Imulungu kotenda ghanoghile kubita ayula iyolonga lugha ing'atsimanyika, ila ka kabaho imunu yungi iyodaha kuwafasilila iwanu choni chayalongile, ili iwanu wose we Imulungu wadahe kwapfilighwa. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Lelo ndughu tsangu, ning'atsa kuna mwemwe na kulonga kwa lugha ing'atsimanyika, angu mwemwe mtsobweda choni? Ng'amtsobweda bae! Ila ka nolonga namwe kwa nzila ya ughubulo, au ukumanya, au imbuli ye Imulungu au malangulitsi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hata ipfinu ipfilihela ughima ipfilapfa litsi kaapfila ichimbeta au chilimba, ka ng'apfilapfa bae litsi tofwautitofauti, imunu yatsomanyatse wila wachi iutowighwa? <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ka malati ng'ailapfa bae litsi pfinoghile, yuhi yatseyandaa kughenda kwing'onde? <verse number="9" style="v"/>Na mwemwe pfipfila, ka ghamlonga ng'aghomanyika bae, yuhi iyodaha kumanya mlonga choni? Apfo mwakuwa ka iwanu iwolonga na libeho. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Muisi mna lugha nyingi, lekeni tsose tsomanyika. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ka simanya bae ichilongighwa ne imunu yungi, nene nakuwa mgheni kwa imunu ayo iyolonga na nene, naye kakuwa mgheni kuna nene. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Pfipfila na mwemwe wose, kwaapfila mwobama ghendo kubokela pfigholelo pfe Ghumuhe, mtende pfomdaha kongesa pfigholelo ipfiwatenda iwanu we Imulungu wabwede.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Apfo ayula iyolonga kwa lugha ing'atsimanyika, yalombe yadahe kuwafasilila iwanu achila chalongile. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Mana ning'alomba kwa lugha ing'atsimanyika, muhe wangu nawo wolomba, lekeni mbutsi tsangu ng'atsitenda chinu bae. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Lelo nitendetse? Nitsolomba kwa ghumuhe wangu, pfipfila nitsolomba kwa mbutsi tsangu, nitsakwimba kwa ghumuhe wangu, pfipfila nitsakwimba kwa mbutsi tsangu. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Ung'amtunya Imulungu wako kwa ghumuhe wako uliheka, ka kuna imunu ing'ayomanya chaulonga, yodahatse kwidika “Ona” haulonga mighede kwe Imulungu ka ng'omanya bae chaulonga? <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kwodaha kulonga mighede kwe Imulungu pfinoghile, lekeni ng'aitsomwapfila bae imunu yungi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nolonga mighede kwe Imulungu kwaapfila nene nolonga lugha ing'atsimanyika kubita mwemwe wose. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Lekeni mne likanisa nonoghelighwa kulonga malonga matano ighomanyika, ili nidahe kuwalangulitsa iwanu wengi kubita kulonga malonga mengi kwa lugha ing'atsimanyika.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ndughu tsangu mleke kutonga ka iwana wadowado, lekeni muwe iwana wadowado mna aghala ghehile, hamtonga muwe ka iwanu wabala. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yandikighwa mne ghamalaghitso,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Imtwatsa kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Kwa nzila ye iwolonga lugha ing'atsimanyika,</para>
  <para style="q">na kwa milomo ya iwahenza,</para>
  <para style="q">nitsolonga ne iwanu wano, hata apfo ng'awatsonihulikitsa bae.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Apfo ukulonga kwa lugha ing'atsimanyika, acho chitango kwa awala ing'awotoghola bae, lekeni si kwa awala iwotoghola, lekeni ukupeta usenga we Imulungu, acho chitango kwa awala iwotoghola na si kwa awala ing'awotoghola bae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Lelo ka iwanu wose we Imulungu wetingana hamwe na chila imunu kolonga lugha ing'atsimanyika, na awala ing'awomanya na ing'awotoghola wang'engila, angu ng'awatsolonga bae ka mna lukwale? <verse number="24" style="v"/>Lekeni wose wang'alonga usenga iweng'ighwe ne Imulungu, iwanu ing'awomanya au ing'awotoghola wang'engila, watsoghahulika ghose ghamlonga, nagho ghatsowahigha. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Na aghala ighapfisike mmoyo mwawo ghatsoghubulighwa, nawo watsopfughama na kumtamanila Imulungu, aku wolonga; “Imulungu ka mghati mwenu ghendo!”</para>
  <para style="s">Choni chitendeke mne kingili lye iwanu we Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Ndughu tsangu, lelo tulonge choni? Hamtingana hamwe kumtamanila Imulungu, yumwe yembe wila, yungi yalangulitse, na yungi yawe na ughubulo iulawa kwe Imulungu, ayu yalonge kwa lugha ing'atsimanyika, yungi yawafasilile iwanu achila ichilongighwe. Ghose ghatendeke kwa kuwapfila iwanu we Imulungu. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Imunu wowose ang'alonga kwa lugha ing'atsimanyika, iwanu weli au wadatu walonge, lekeni walonge yumweyumwe aku kukale na imunu yungi iyowafasilila achila ichilongighwa. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Lekeni ka kuduhu imunu iyowafasilila iwanu achila ichilongighwa, imunu iyolonga kwa lugha ing'atsimanyika yanyamale, na yelongele mwenyegho ne Imulungu. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Iwanu weli au wadatu iweng'ighwe usenga we Imulungu walonge aku iwanu wangi walamule achila ichilongighwe. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Lekeni ka imunu yali mne mtingano kabokela usenga we Imulungu, ayula iyolonga yanyamale. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Kwaapfila mwose mwodaha kulonga yumweyumwe usenga wamwing'ighwe ne Imulungu, ili chila imunu yelangulitse na yaghumighwe ghumoyo. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Muhe tse manabii tsowategheletsa manabii. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Kwaapfila Imulungu si Imulungu wa kutenda pfinu chakachaka bae, ila yeye ka Imulungu wa tindiwalo.</para>
  <para style="p">Pfipfila ka pfaili mne makingilli ghe iwanu we Imulungu, <verse number="34" style="v"/>iwapinga wanyamale mne makingilli ghe iwanu we Imulungu, ng'awobamighwa bae kulonga, wala kulongotsa ka Ghamalaghitso gha Wayahudi pfagholonga. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Wang'abama kumanya mbuli yoyose ila, wawaghuse wamale wawo ukaye yawo, mana chinu cha chinyala kwe ipinga kulonga mbuli yoyose mne kingili lye iwanu we Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Pfii mwopfikitsa imbuli ye Imulungu ilawa kuna mwemwe au iwapfikila mwemwe mliheka? <verse number="37" style="v"/>Imunu wowose iyebona keng'ighwa usenga we Imulungu au kana gholelo lya Ghumuhe, yatange ghendo ka chanikwandika, nakwandika laghitso lye Imtwatsa. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Imunu ang'aghabetsa ghano, naye yabetsighwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Apfo ndughu tsangu, msulukile kuwalongela iwanu imbuli ye Imulungu, kuya mleke kuwaghoma iwanu kulonga lugha ing'atsimanyika. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Ghose ghatendeke ghoya na pfinoghile.</para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kutsilihuka kwa Kiristu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Lelo ndughu tsangu nobama niwalongele keli Imbuli Inoghile yaniwapetele, yamuibokele iili lukwalambatsa lwa ukutogha kwenu, na mna ayo mwemwe mwakwima ghendo. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Usenga awo yaniwapetele iyo Imbuli Inoghile, mwemwe mwokombolighwa mng'ahakinda ghoya aghala ghaniwapetele, ka si pfipfo bae mtoghola hela.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Niwagholela aghala ghanibokele nene mwenyegho, Kiristu tsakafa kwa nzambi tsetu ka pfagholonga Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka, <verse number="4" style="v"/>tsakasikighwa, na katsilihuka mna litsuwa lya kadatu, ka Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka pfagholonga, <verse number="5" style="v"/>tanu tsakamlawila Petiri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">taghwa lyake lingi Kefa</char></note> kuya kawalawila watumighwa wose 12. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Pfipfila kawalawila ndughu ka 500 kwa mala lumwe, wengi mna wawo waghima mbaka sambi, lekeni wangi wawo ma wahupa. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hambele kamlawila Jakobu, kuya kawalawila watumighwa wose.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Pfipfila kandawila nene, ka imunu yanyelekighwe mne chipindi si chake bae. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kwaapfila nene na mtumighwa mdodo, sinoghile bae kukemighwa mtumighwa, kwaapfila tsanighadununza makingili ghe iwanu we Imulungu. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Lekeni uluso we Imulungu, unitenda niwe ka pfino pfanili, uluso wangaile, ng'angaile hela bae. Nene tsanisang'ana kubita iwatumighwa wose, si nene bae, ila uluso we Imulungu tsausang'ana hamwe na nene. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Hata apfo iwe nene au wawo iwoipeta Imbuli inoghile si chinu bae, acho chicho chatupeta na chicho chamtoghola.</para>
  <para style="s">Ukutsilihuka kwe iwanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Lekeni ka tsaipetighwa Kiristu katsilihuka, wamwenga wenu wodahatse kulonga kuduhu kutsilihuka? <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ka kuduhu kutsilihuka kwe iwanu, apfo Kiristu naye ng'atsilihuke bae, <verse number="14" style="v"/>kuya ka Kiristu ng'atsilihuke bae, chatuwapetela si chinu bae, pfipfila chamtoghola si chinu bae. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Kubita ghose, pfipfila twetwe twoneka tulonga ughutsu hambele he Imulungu, kwaapfila tsatulonga Imulungu kamtsilihula Kiristu, kumbe ng'amtsilihule bae, ka iwanu iwafile ng'awotsilihuka bae. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kwaapfila ka iwafile ng'awatsilihuka bae, Kiristu naye ng'atsilihuke bae. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kuya ka Kiristu ng'atsilihuke bae, ukutoghola kwenu kwahela sang'ano, na nzambi tsenu mng'ali natso. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Pfipfila wanu iwafile aku womtoghola Kiristu wagha. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Ka tumlolela Yesu Kiristu mna ughima uno uliheka, twobamighwa twonelighwe libatsi kubita iwanu wose.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Lekeni kwo ukulongesa ghendo Kiristu katsilihuka, yeye iyo wa mwanduso we iwanu iwawasile mlifwa, apfo yolangusa iwanu wangi watsotsilihuka. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Mana ka lifwa lighalighwa ne imunu yumwe, pfipfila kutsilihuka nako kughalighwa ne imunu yumwe. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Ka iwanu wose pfawakufa kwa ukwilunga na Adamu, pfipfila kubitila Kiristu iwanu wose watsakuwa waghima. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Lekeni chila imunu na hanu hake, tanu Kiristu, kuya awala iwali wake Kiristu hayatsakuya. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Kuya utsighilo utsakutsa, Kiristu hayatsomwing'a Undewa Aba Imulungu, hayamalitsa kuhinya utawala na ukulu na ngupfu tsose itsihile. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Kwaapfila Kiristu kobamighwa yatawale mbaka Imulungu yaweke iwanebe wose hasi he ghamaghulu ghake. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Lifwa iyo mwihile wa usighilo iyatsokomighwa. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Mana Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka gholonga, “Imulungu keka pfinu pfose hasi he maghulu ghake.” Lekeni ghamaandiko hagholonga, “Pfinu pfose pfikighwa hasi he maghulu ghake yapfitawale,” yakoneka ghendo Imulungu ng'alimumo bae mna pfinu apfo, kwaapfila yeye iyo iyekile pfinu apfo hasi he ghamaghulu gha Kiristu. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Lekeni hayatsakwika pfinu pfose hasi he ghamaghulu gha Kiristu, naye Imwana katseika mwenyegho hasi he Imulungu, ili Imulungu yatawale ghendo chila chinu chila hanu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Lelo ka kuduhu kutsilihuka, watsotendatse awala iwabatitsighwe kwaajili ye iwanu iwafile? Ka iwafile ng'awotsilihuka bae, ule iwanu wobatisighwa kwaajili yawo? <verse number="30" style="v"/>Na twetwe, ebali twehonza chila saa? <verse number="31" style="v"/>Wandughu, noulapfa ughima wangu chila litsuwa, neghoda kwaajili yenu mna ukwilunga na Yesu Kiristu Imtwatsa wetu. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Ka ukwitowa kwangu ne iwanu iwakalile ka iwanyama wane usongo akula Efeso tsanitowa kwa mbuli tse chimunu, angu nipatile choni? Lekeni iwanu iwafile ka ng'awotsilihulighwa bae, leka, “Tuje na tunwe kwaapfila ilupfi twakufa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Mleke kughutsukighwa. “Usale wihile wohinya chitsowelo chinoghile.” <verse number="34" style="v"/>Mlamke lelo! Mleke kutenda nzambi, kwaapfila kuna iwanu wamwenga mghati mwenu ng'awammanyile ghendo Imulungu, chinyala kuna mwemwe kwa ghano ghanongile.</para>
  <para style="s">Iwanu pfawatsotsilihulighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Lekeni munu kodaha kughutsa, “Apfi iwanu wotsilihukatse? Watsokuwa na lukuli lwachi?” <verse number="36" style="v"/>Mleke kuwa wabotsi! Imbeghu yuhanda ng'aikota bae mbaka ife tanu. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Hauhanda, kohanda imbeghu iliheka, iwe ya uhemba au ya mitama au mbeghu tsingi, ng'uhanda mbiki wose iulawila hambele. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Lekeni Imulungu koing'a mbeghu ayo lumbo ka pfoyobama na chila mbeghu ina lumbo lyake.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Ng'uli tse pfilumbe ng'atsighala bae. Iwanu wana lukuli lwawo na iwanyama wana lukuli lwawo, wapfideghe wana lukuli lwawo na iwasomba wana lukuli lwawo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Kuya kuna ng'uli tsa kulanga na tsa muisi, ukunogha kwe ng'uli tsa kulanga ng'akwighala ne ukunogha kwe ng'uli tsa muisi. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Litsua lina ukunogha kwake na lwetsi luna ukunogha kwake na tsinondo tsina ukunogha kwake, na hata tsinondo natso ng'atsighala bae mna ukunogha.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Apfi pfipfo pfaitsakuwa hawatsotsilihuka iwanu. Ka pfaili imbeghu, lukuli lotsikighwa aku lwola, lekeni lwotsilihuka aku lughima. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Lwotsikighwa mna chinyala, lotsilihuka mna utunitso, lwotsikighwa aku lwahela ngupfu lwotsilihuka aku luna ngupfu. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Haulutsikighwa, lwotsikighwa lukuli lwa chimunu, kuya lwotsilihuka lukuli lwe chimuhe. Ka hana lukuli lwa chimunu, pfipfila hana lukuli lwa chimuhe. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Mana Ghamaandiko gholonga, “Imunu we mwanduso, Adamu, tsakawa imunu mghima,” lekeni Adamu wa usighilo iyo Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka iyoweng'a iwanu ughima. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Si lukuli lwa ghumuhe bae iulongola, ila lukuli lwa chimunu, kuya lukuli lwa chimuhe. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Adamu wa mwanduso tsakalawa mne timbwisi lye isi, Adamu wa keli tsakalawa kulanga. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Awala we iisi weghala na ayula iyalawile muisi, na awala we kulanga weghala na ayula iyalawile kulanga. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Ka pfatwighalile na ayula yalumbighwe na lidongo, pfipfila twitseghala na ayula yalawile kulanga. <verse number="50" style="v"/>Ndughu tsangu chonilonga hano chicho chino, lukuli lwe imunu ng'aludaha bae kuhala Undewa we Imulungu, wala aghala ighohinyika ng'aghodaha bae kuleka ukuhinyika.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Tegheletseni, nowalongelelani mbuli; wose ng'atutsokufa bae, ila wose tutsoghaluka, <verse number="52" style="v"/>malati haitsolila, baho, iwanu iwafile watsotsilihulighwa aku ng'uli tsawo ng'atsolile bae, kuya na twetwe ng'atutsakufa ila tutsoghaluka. <verse number="53" style="v"/>Mana aghala ighohinyika ghobamighwa ghaghaluke ghawe ing'aghohinyika bae, lukuli ulukufa lughaluke luleke kufa. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Apfo lukuli luno iluhinyika halutsoghaluka luleke kuhinyika, na achila ichikufa hachitsoghaluka chileke kufa, baho ghatsotimila Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka igholonga, “Lifwa likomighwa, ukuhuma kutimila!”</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v"/>Ghwe lifwa kulikwani ukuhuma kwako?</para>
  <para style="q">Ghwe lifwa ulikwani usungu wako?</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="56" style="v"/>Lifwa lyopata ngupfu yo ukulagha kulawa mnzambi, na nzambi yopata ngupfu mne Ghamalaghitso gha Musa. <verse number="57" style="v"/>Lekeni mighede kwe Imulungu iyotutenda tuhume kubitila Imtwatsa wetu Yesu Kiristu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v"/>Apfo ndughu tsangu mwime ghoya, mleke kuhighisika. Matsuwa ghose mghendelele ghendo kusang'ana ing'onde ye Imtwatsa, kwaapfila mmanye isang'ano yamsang'ana mghati mwa Imtwatsa ng'aikwagha hela bae.</para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Msango kwe iwanu we Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Lelo nonge imbuli yokuwasangila iwanu we Imulungu, mtende achila chanighalongele makingili ghe iwanu we Imulungu gha Wagalatiya. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Chila jumapili, chila munu mghati mwenu yabaghule sendi iilawa mna achila choyobokela, kuya yeke ili hanikutsa ndeke kubama msango keli. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kuya hanipfika kuna mwemwe nitsowatuma awala yamuwasaghula waghale ibaluwa na msango wenu Yerusalemu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ka pfinogha na nene kughenda ako, watselongotsa na nene.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Hanitsobita kughenda Makedoniya, tanu nitsakutsa kuna mwemwe, mana nobama kughenda Makedoniya. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nodaha kukala na mwemwe chidogho, au kukala namwe matsuwa ghose gha chipfeghetsi, ili mnyapfile mna ghumwanza wangu kokose konighenda. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Sibama bae kwibona na mwemwe kwa kubita kuliheka, nobama nikale namwe chidogho Imtwatsa ang'abama.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Lekeni nitsokala hano Efeso mbaka litsuwa lya Pentekoste, <verse number="9" style="v"/>kwaapfila libani lya mwatsi kwa sang'ano yangu ng'ulu hano, hata ka kuna iwanu wengi iwobela ghanilonga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Timoteo ang'atsa mumtende aleke kwalangula chinu chochose hayatsokala na mwemwe, kwaapfila yeye kosang'ana ing'onde ye Imtwatsa ka nene. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Apfo imunu wowose yaleke kumbetsa, ila mwapfileni yaghendelele tseghamba na ghumwanza wake ili yadahe kumbuyila. Mana nomlolela yoye ne iwanu wangi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Lelo nonge mbuli ya ndughu yetu Apolo, tsanimkomangitsa yamwangileni hamwe na iwandughu wangi. Lekeni ng'obama bae kutsa sambi, lekeni katsakutsa hayatsopata uleghelo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Mkale meso, mwikindilise mne ukutoghola, mwime chilume na muwe iwanu wane ngupfu. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Msang'ane ghose kwa kwinoghela.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Mwommanya Stefana na iwanu wa mkaye mwake, wawo tsawalongola kuwa wakiristu ako Akaya, kuya tsawelapfa wenyegho kuwasang'anila iwanu we Imulungu. Apfo ndughu tsangu nowalomba, <verse number="16" style="v"/>muwategheletse iwanu ka awo na chila imunu iyosang'ana nawo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Tsandeng'ela hawatsile Stefana na Fotonata na Akaiko, kwaapfila tsawamemesa achila ichihunguke kuna mwemwe. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Mana tsawadeng'eletsa ghumoyo ghwangu ka pfawamdeng'eletseni mwemwe. Iwanu awo pfinogha wang'akumbukighwa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Makingili ghe iwanu we Imulungu gha Asiya ghomlamsani. Akila na Pilisila ne iwanu wose iwotingana mkaye mwawo womlamsani kwa taghwa lye Imtwatsa. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Wandughu wose iwali hano womlamsani.</para>
  <para style="p">Mwilamse kwa kulangusa unoghelo wa Kiristu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nene, Pauli nowalamsani, nakwandika kwa ghumoko ghwangu mwenyegho.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Imunu wowose iyolema kumnoghela Imtwatsa, ayo yalighitwe. Utse ghwe Imtwatsa wetu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Uluso we Imtwatsa Yesu ukale namwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Unoghelo wangu ukale na mwemwe wose yamli mghati mwa Kiristu Yesu.</para>
</usx>
